SUMMARY:🌼 Flower day · ♒ Aquarius
DESCRIPTION:Moon in Aquarius (Air)\n\nSowing & planting: Sow and plant crop
 s grown for their flowers.\nHarvesting: Cut flowers for the vase (they sta
 y fresh and fragrant)\, medicinal flowers for drying and oils.\nOther work
 : Hoe around flowering plants\, work with bees\, spray 501 (horn silica) i
 n the morning.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
